{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52765","headline":"游洞门题陈氏丹台诗 · 张九龄","name":"游洞门题陈氏丹台诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鷄头西畔洞门开，陈氏丹昇劫仞台。\n𩳛鬼（《体道通监》作「鬽」）昔年诚誓否\n至今犹说鬼肩栽。\n（见《宛委别藏》本宋陈田夫《南岳总胜集》卷中「洞门观」条。\n又见《历世真仙体道通监》卷三三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}